  "title": "Scenario 2 - Auto Liability for Delivery Access",
  "formType": "acord-25",
  "summary": "Harbor Fresh Produce Delivery emails about a City of Orlando permit. The city's ask goes beyond what the auto policy actually provides — verify against the file before you check any boxes.",
  "instructions": [
    "Read the email from Harbor Fresh and check every request against the automobile policy file below — a request doesn't make it true.",
    "Complete the producer, insured, insurer, certificate number, Automobile Liability section, description, and certificate holder.",
    "Only mark an endorsement (additional insured, waiver of subrogation) as granted if the policy file says it's actually in force.",
    "Leave General Liability, Umbrella/Excess, and Workers Compensation blank — there is no file for those coverages on this account.",
    "A perfect score is required to unlock the next scenario."
